SOAPBOX: I entered this year just to play with my new FT- 991A - before a DX-expedition to YB5 in January 2026.
SOAPBOX: Very basic setup - Ft991A running 90W to a 6.2M vertical with an UNUN at the feedpoint, logging was using Polo - an android telephone app!! It worked perfectly, very fast and super easy to use.
SOAPBOX: I entered the Classic overlay mode on SO-AB-LP. So was active less that 24 hours.
